# NV-11 — Tuong tac nguoi dung

UC: 114-126  
Actors: public user, internal officer  
Status: specified; basic toast/session interactions mocked.

## Scope

Public timeline, rating, clarification, personal notices, language/help, question history, answer PDF, system feedback and internal notices/login history.

## Acceptance criteria

- Timeline only exposes events allowed to the actor.
- Rating/clarification is linked to a published answer and cannot alter official content.
- Personal notifications can be read/archived without exposing another user's data.
- PDF export carries dossier code and generated timestamp.

## Test mapping

`notification.service.spec.ts` (planned).

